{
 "desc": "Play as Luigi: each of Mario's 62 voice clips asked for in turn (as a script's evt_snd_sfxon), 50 frames apart, then Petal Meadows' battle 0 with a jump and the win; TTYD_VOICE_TRACE logs every voice clip that starts ('[voice] CLIP for MARIO_CLIP (pick, pitch, volume, cut)'), the mixed sound in audio.wav (tools/port/voice_wav.py events)",
